error: `map_or` replaces `Error` with a fallback value
   --> tools/dylint/examples/needless_import_rename.rs:137:42
    |
137 |     let rendered = rendered(&Map::new()).map_or(0, |text| text.len());
    |                                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = help: match the `Result`, handle each error the caller acts on, and return the rest with `?`
    = note: `#[deny(discarded_error)]` on by default

error: `UnsafeCell` renamed to `Cell` with no other `UnsafeCell` in scope
 --> tools/dylint/examples/needless_import_rename.rs:2:5
  |
